-- German framework round: proposed links from the four synthetic spaces to German framework and policy records that few spaces reached.
-- 25 proposed links (8 interdisciplinary, 11 bio-core, 2 social-core, 4 computational-core) onto 9 existing German records:
-- the 2026 trial Lehrplan editions for Biologie and Mensch-Natur-Technik in Thüringen (from the two-pass concept tagging of 2 Nov), KMK strategy and Abitur texts, and state records on subjects and cross-subject work.
-- All of it is AI-drafted and has not been reviewed by a person. The relation type starts with proposed_, which the views show as "AI-drafted, unconfirmed".
-- A person confirms, edits or removes each one. No record, view, role or repository link is created or changed here.
--
